# PEOS canonical text and manifest integrity
# Keep bytes stable across Windows Git Bash, Linux and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
